{
 "about": "NordicCiv's reviewed selection of public camera uplinks. Each entry is a camera its operator publishes for anyone to watch; NordicCiv keeps a name, a position, a category and the provider's public viewing page, and only links to it. A camera appears only after review: new cameras on a provider's map stay out until they are added here. Display names are NordicCiv's own short descriptions of what the provider lists.",
 "reviewed": "2026-11-27",
 "policy": {
  "include": "Cameras intentionally published for public viewing on the operator's or a webcam publisher's public page, showing a place: settlements, mountains and valleys, fjords and coasts, islands, tourist destinations, ski resorts, weather observation, nature and viewpoints.",
  "exclude": [
   "traffic and road-monitoring cameras",
   "private, residential or exposed network cameras and unpublished endpoints",
   "cameras aimed at people (shops, queues, courts, skateparks, street-level squares and parks)",
   "vendor demonstrations, test and copy listings",
   "golf courses, motorsport, airfields and construction sites",
   "cameras whose owner does not say what they show",
   "listings whose published position contradicts the place they name",
   "duplicates of a camera already listed",
   "pages served only over plain http"
  ],
  "positions": "Published positions are used as published. Pages without coordinates are placed at the Wikidata coordinates of the place they show and marked as place positions.",
  "duplicates": "One record per camera. Where the same camera is listed by several providers, the operator's own page is preferred, then the listing with a published position.",
  "status": "Nothing here says a camera is live or working: that is only known on the provider's page."
 },
